meta {
  name: User Profile
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/user/profile
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
  Accept-Language: oz
}

docs {
  Kirgan foydalanuvchining o'z profili. **Bu so'rov `userToken` ni ishlatadi**,
  kolleksiya darajasidagi staff tokenini EMAS — shuning uchun `Authorization`
  header'i qo'lda yozilgan.

  Avval `User Register Verify` yoki `User Login Verify` ni yuboring, ular
  `userToken` ni to'ldiradi.

  Javob:

  ```json
  { "id": 1, "full_name": "...", "phone": "998901234567", "img": null, "status": true, "created_at": "..." }
  ```

  | Xato | Sabab |
  |---|---|
  | `401` token yaroqsiz | token yo'q, muddati tugagan yoki logout qilingan |
  | `401` bloklangan | `status: false` |

  DIQQAT: staff tokeni bu endpointga kirmaydi, user tokeni ham `/api/*` admin
  endpointlariga kirmaydi — ikki tizim bir-biridan to'liq ajratilgan.
}
